        "text": "<p>I'm Jan Ryczkowski. I was born in Doncaster and now live at my grandad's in Podkarpackie, in the south-east of Poland.</p><p>He keeps the bees. I run the shop, the orders and the deliveries, and my mum packs the UK orders in Doncaster.</p><p>We only sell honey from our own hives, so there is only so much each year. When it runs out, the next jars come with the next harvest.</p>"
