        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "My honey has gone thick or grainy. Is that normal?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Raw honey crystallises over time. Honeydew honey does it slowly, but it will happen. To make it runny again, stand the closed jar in warm water, below 40°C, and stir now and then.</p>"
